#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "A faulted workflow stops at the task, and can be retried from it. The Failed outcome lets the workflow go on, for example to notify someone; the error is the task's last result."
msgstr "Un workflow en erreur s’arrête à la tâche et peut être relancé à partir de celle-ci. Le résultat Échec permet au workflow de continuer, par exemple pour avertir quelqu’un ; l’erreur est le dernier résultat de la tâche."

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Delay (seconds)"
msgstr "Délai (secondes)"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Delay between retries"
msgstr "Délai entre les tentatives"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Doubling the delay gives a service that's down more time to come back, up to a day between retries."
msgstr "Le doublement du délai laisse plus de temps à un service indisponible pour redevenir opérationnel, jusqu’à un jour entre les tentatives."

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Fault the workflow"
msgstr "Mettre le workflow en erreur"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Follow the Failed outcome"
msgstr "Suivre le résultat Échec"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "How long to wait before the first retry. With zero, the task is retried at once; otherwise the instance waits, faulted, and is retried within a minute of the delay."
msgstr "Durée d’attente avant la première tentative. Avec zéro, la tâche est relancée immédiatement ; sinon, l’instance attend, passe en erreur, puis est relancée dans un délai d’une minute."

#. Format arguments: {0}: ActivityRetryPolicy.MaxRetriesLimit
#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
#, csharp-format
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "How many times the task is retried, up to {0}. Leave it at zero to not retry it."
msgstr "Nombre de fois où la tâche est relancée, jusqu’à {0}. Laissez la valeur à zéro pour ne pas la relancer."

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Once the retries are spent"
msgstr "Une fois les tentatives épuisées"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Retries"
msgstr "Tentatives"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "Retry the task when it throws, for example when a service it calls is down for a moment."
msgstr "Relancer la tâche lorsqu’elle génère une erreur, par exemple lorsqu’un service appelé est momentanément indisponible."

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
msgid "The same each time"
msgstr "Le même délai à chaque fois"

#: Views/ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.ActivityRetryPolicy.Edit"
