msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.WorkflowDesigner.WorkflowDesignerSettings"
msgid "The expiration in milliseconds of the lock acquired before resuming a workflow instance of this type atomically. Leave it to zero to not use any locking."
msgstr "Expiration en millisecondes du verrou acquis avant la reprise atomique d’une instance de workflow de ce type. Laissez zéro pour ne pas utiliser de verrouillage."

