msgstr "Le nom du workflow."

#: Views/WorkflowDesigner/WorkflowDesignerSettings.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.WorkflowDesigner.WorkflowDesignerSettings"
msgid "The timeout in milliseconds to acquire a lock before resuming a given workflow instance of this type atomically. Leave it to zero to not use any locking."
msgstr "Délai en millisecondes pour acquérir un verrou avant la reprise atomique d’une instance de workflow donnée de ce type. Laissez zéro pour ne pas utiliser de verrouillage."

