msgctxt "OrchardCore.Workflows.Views.WorkflowDesigner.WorkflowDesignerSettings"
msgid "Uncheck to prevent workflows of this type from being executed."
msgstr "Décochez cette option pour empêcher l’exécution des workflows de ce type."

